cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the thesis given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "chapter5_geomaca: GeoMACA, CityBuilder and Level-Based Foraging experiments"
abstract: >-
  The experiments of Chapter 5 of the thesis: GeoMACA (Geographic Multi-Agent
  Credit Assignment), the CityBuilder simulator with its government agents and
  the Spatial Developer CNN, the Heuristic, QMIX and COMA baselines, the
  Level-Based Foraging experiments, and the evaluation and analysis code that
  produces the chapter's tables and figure.
